{"id":"n65914-2-6","stage":4,"title":"십자가 · 十字架","scene":"文化与信仰","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65914-2-6-1","ko":"나 교회 다니는 거 어떻게 알았어?","zh":"你怎么知道我去教堂的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"교회","meaning":"教会","explanation":"교회：教会","readings":[{"term":"교회","audio":"/audio/24c3101dae86eeec60ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64370","senseId":"1","lemma":"교회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"교회","audio":"/audio/24c3101dae86eeec60ee.mp3"}},{"text":"다니는","meaning":"上班，上学，上","explanation":"다니다：上班，上学，上；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"3","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다니는","audio":"/audio/dd9ad12ce6de18d5fef5.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、行为或情况（것 的口语形式）","explanation":"거 是 것 的口语形式，把前面的修饰内容概括为事物、行为或情况。这里不表示指示代词“那个”；具体的时态、疑问或推测语气结合前后的语尾理解。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"알았어?","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알았어","audio":"/audio/dede206a3da7cc7d567c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"24c3101dae86eeec","term":"교회","zh":"教会","audio":"/audio/24c3101dae86eeec60ee.mp3","entryId":"64370","definition":"把耶稣基督视为救世主而信仰并追随的人们的共同体；或指那种人聚集在一起举行宗教活动的场所。","pronunciation":["교ː회","교ː훼"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"上班，上学，上","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"定期往返于职场或学校等地方。","pronunciation":["다니다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、行为或情况","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、行为或情况","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/33f6390dd4e80d66f9b6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65914-2-6-2","ko":"네 목에 십자가 목걸이가 걸려 있어서 알았지.","zh":"因为你的脖子上挂着十字架项链，所以我才知道的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","explanation":"네：“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84427","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"목에","meaning":"脖子，颈","explanation":"목：脖子，颈；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"목","audio":"/audio/5fbc9add7bd4911bb918.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89861","senseId":"1","lemma":"목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfa